QUERY NAME: ltd2000-C
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT WorkGroup.ProfitCentre, TimeCostCalcs.WorkGroup, Sum(TimeCostCalcs.Cost) AS SOCT
FROM (tlkpProject INNER JOIN TimeCostCalcs ON tlkpProject.ParentProject = TimeCostCalcs.Project) INNER JOIN WorkGroup ON TimeCostCalcs.WorkGroup = WorkGroup.WorkGroup
WHERE ((Not (tlkpProject.Program)="TEst_Port"))
GROUP BY WorkGroup.ProfitCentre, TimeCostCalcs.WorkGroup
HAVING (((WorkGroup.ProfitCentre)="labt"));

